{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_03_beg","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_03","title":"音樂室內的光芒","storyCode":"SS-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a42bd0109de05abf2b93b3b98b793baeb5aef118a00e3ed725c151fc05f5025a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在海鈴的夢境中，海鈴剛出獄便遭到了前雇主的打手弗朗西斯的追殺，隨後她又收到了來自“老爺”的邀請，讓她加入其家族。祥子在尋找海鈴的途中遇到了弗朗西斯，發現了可疑之處。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g10_dreamcastlestage"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>大雨如淚水一般落下，我只是無垠海水中的一滴。</i>\n<i>獨行的夜，不再迷茫。</i>\n<i>我，毋畏恐懼。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cellroomC"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"犯人48038，出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"長官，請問有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"檢查個人物品，沒有忘記帶的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，全部都帶齊了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沿著走廊往前面走，走到盡頭的那個小窗口，簽名離開就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的犯人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好的，謝謝長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有力的小跑聲在長廊上迴盪。\n沉悶的皮靴聲則一點點向走廊的最深處靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"海鈴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獄警","speakerId":"avg_npc_134","isRemote":false,"text":"滾吧，今年別讓我再看到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海鈴熟練地拿起自己的琴盒，慢悠悠地走出了監獄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g6_newtown_street"},{"type":"narration","text":"敘拉古還是和從前一樣，用連綿的小雨迎接她的回歸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這條街，還有前後兩條街，每家店都派人盯著，絕對不能讓她跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"謹慎的打手 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的打手 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥，北街那邊傳來消息，她朝這邊過來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給我盯著她，別讓她跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌張的打手 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她……她好像沒有要躲的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……讓其他人都過來集合！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"narration","text":"狹窄的胡同裡，一群兇神惡煞的打手，正將提著琴盒的少女團團圍住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了……海鈴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，我一開始還在想，你這種高手，怎麼沒有一個家族把你納入麾下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們家族遭逢變故後，四處打聽，才知道原來你是個臭名昭著的“叛徒”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你前後換過十幾個名字，在各個家族間幫人做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的合約裡沒有寫我不能幫別人做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我早就說過——我只是拿人錢財，替人消災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就把我們的機密告訴了敵對陣營？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不懂你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*哥倫比亞粗口*，別裝傻了！自從你來過之後，我們的人就不斷遭到暗算！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帶頭的打手","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虧我和老大當時那麼信任你，還邀請你加入我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗朗西斯，我不記得我有做過什麼對不起你們的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，是你虧欠的人實在太多，想都想不起來了吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老大死了，大家都死了，幾百個人現在只剩我們十幾個了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一群兄弟好不容易從哥倫比亞漂泊到這個鬼地方，結果全被你害死了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的打手 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要跟她講這麼多廢話了，我們這麼多人在這裡，今天一定要好好修理她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想和你們起衝突……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雖然海鈴努力想要透過言語平息衝突，但對方逼近的腳步完全沒有停下來——\n她不得不放下拿在手上的琴盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人……跟我上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_rainsplash"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，不要再往前走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那邊剛剛發生了一點事，你一個人過去很危險，還是繞路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著帽子的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝提醒。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女並沒有理會路人的勸告，而是朝她說的方向繼續走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g2_srcalley"},{"type":"narration","text":"雨淅淅瀝瀝地下著，沖刷著敘拉古的一切。\n少女走進小巷，這裡乾乾淨淨，彷彿是剛建好一樣，一塵不染。\n敘拉古的清潔工總是這麼專業。\n潮濕的空氣中，聞不到一絲血腥味。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海鈴……你在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在……找海鈴嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座娛樂場裡的撞球間。沒有人會想到，有人把這裡當成自己的家。\n幾個紙箱簡單地拼成了一張床，最基本的生活用品全被塞進了速食店贈送的袋子裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"撞球桌上擺滿了信封，裡面裝著海鈴的酬勞。\n海鈴一一拆開這些信封，將裡面的金幣隨手丟在桌上，一枚枚印刻著“家族”、“秩序”的金幣很快堆成了一座小山。\n這些金幣就這樣被隨意地放在毫無保護的地方，就算不見了，她也完全不會心疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海鈴再次確認了一遍——這封信裡什麼都沒有。\n她將信封翻了過來，上面印著一枚家族印記，還有一個寄件地址。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g7_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嚴肅的打手 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_699_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，她來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"監獄裡的那些人，沒有找你麻煩吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都認識多久了，更何況，他們都知道我背後的雇主是誰，何必自找麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過老爺特地把我叫來，恐怕不只是為了問我這種小事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，就只是單純關心一下合作夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，我們什麼時候變成合作夥伴了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之前簽合約時，你甚至不願意以你家族的名義委託我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然想成為“合作夥伴”，從現在起當然要坦誠相見——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海鈴，我想和你做筆長期生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼生意必須當面談？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒼老的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想——邀請你加入我的家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說……什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面沒人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明那麼怕她，為什麼還要跟過來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是家族成員，當然不懂！我必須……幫大家報仇雪恨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們和海鈴之間到底發生過什麼事，她那麼不可饒恕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你經歷過這種“背叛”，一定也不會原諒她……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們家族大部分的成員都是從哥倫比亞拓荒區逃到這裡的普通人，缺少人脈和背景，所以常常被當地的幫派找碴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種情況持續了很多年，直到有一天，老大花重金請來了一個打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人是海鈴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。僱傭她以後，我們度過了很長一段時間的安穩日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那段日子真的很美好，再也不用擔心據點突然被人偷襲，也不用擔心有人上門來找麻煩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們邀請她加入我們家族時，她卻拒絕了，而且第二天她整個人還直接消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正當我們覺得疑惑的時候，不知道是誰引來跟我們敵對陣營的打手，偷襲了我們的據點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我至今都不願回想那個場面……實在太慘了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得是海鈴出賣了你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了她還有可能是誰？哪有這麼巧的事情？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不相信海鈴會做出這種背信棄義的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識的海鈴和你說的一樣，能力強大，令人安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且會對自己加入的組織盡職盡責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，事實就擺在我的面前……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有在那群偷襲你們的人當中看見她的身影嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還記得那些偷襲者的面貌嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一輩子都忘不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子深吸了一口氣，將手伸向口袋裡的防身武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……是有人故意挑撥你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果……是有人一直在監視海鈴呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗朗西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_698_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"弗朗西斯還沒反應過來，四周的櫃門突然全部被推開。\n每個櫃子裡都站著一個身形魁梧的打手，他們手裡拿著武器，一齊指向房間中央的兩人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神秘的打手們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不准動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
